 "remarks": "Ideally situated in Mid-City Stamford, this fresh, modern condo is just minutes from Metro-North and close to downtown dining, shopping, entertainment, and everyday conveniences.  Truly move-in ready, this beautifully renovated 1-bedroom, 1.5-bath condo has been thoughtfully updated from top to bottom. Brand-new LVP flooring flows throughout the bright, open-concept interior, complemented by a completely redesigned kitchen featuring new cabinetry, quartz countertops, and brand-new stainless steel appliances. Both the full and half baths have been fully renovated with fresh, contemporary finishes, while a full-size brand-new washer and dryer provide the convenience of in-unit laundry.  The sun-filled living area opens directly to a private balcony, while the generously sized primary bedroom features a walk-in closet and its own balcony access through glass doors. Water heater is also brand new.Dedicated parking in the under-building garage adds everyday convenience, and residents also enjoy access to the building's fitness and sauna rooms.",
